# Pull request workflow

Use when creating or preparing a PR for `storyboard`.

## Prerequisites

```bash
gh --version
gh auth status
git status --short
git branch --show-current
```

If `gh` is missing or not authenticated, ask the user to install or log in before creating the PR.

## Base branch and diff

```bash
git remote show origin | grep "HEAD branch"
git log origin/main..HEAD --oneline --no-decorate
git diff origin/main..HEAD --stat
```

If the default branch is not `main`, substitute it in the commands.

## PR body

- If **`.github/pull_request_template.md`** exists, follow it exactly.
- Include summary, motivation, implementation notes, and **tests / verification**.
- Note when verification was limited (e.g. scripts not present).

## Create PR

Use a temp file for the body:

```bash
gh pr create --title "PR_TITLE" --body-file /tmp/storyboard-pr-body.md --base main
```

Remove the temp file after success.
